        <p>『ひどい<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41622-41637"><rb>蛆</rb><rt>うじ</rt></ruby>だなア。』と、一<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41661-41679"><rb>番</rb><rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41679-41694"><rb>近</rb><rt>ちか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41694-41697">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41697-41709"><rb>寄</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41709-41715">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41715-41736"><rb>某家</rb><rt>ぼうけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41736-41739">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41739-41757"><rb>武士</rb><rt>ぶし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41757-41760">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41760-41775"><rb>側</rb><rt>そば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41775-41790">からでも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41790-41811"><rb>死體</rb><rt>したい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41811-41829">まではまだ一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41829-41856"><rb>間半</rb><rt>けんはん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41856-41868">ばかりの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41868-41889"><rb>距離</rb><rt>きより</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41889-41906">があつた。</seg></p>
        <p>『もつと<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41918-41933"><rb>近</rb><rt>ちか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41933-41939">うお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41939-41951"><rb>寄</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41951-41975">りなさい。それで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41975-41996"><rb>檢死</rb><rt>けんし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41996-41999">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41999-42020"><rb>役目</rb><rt>やくめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42020-42023">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42023-42035"><rb>濟</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby>みますか。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42056-42068"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42068-42071">ひ</seg><choice source="#source-42071-42077"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-42077-42080">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42080-42104"><rb>玄竹</rb><rt>げんちく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42104-42107">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42107-42122"><rb>腐</rb><rt>くさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42122-42128">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42128-42149"><rb>死體</rb><rt>したい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42149-42152">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42152-42167"><rb>右</rb><rt>みぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42167-42170">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42170-42188"><rb>左</rb><rt>ひだり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42188-42194">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42194-42218"><rb>幾度</rb><rt>いくたび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42218-42248">もひつくりかへした。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42248-42263"><rb>皮</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42263-42266">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42266-42281"><rb>破</rb><rt>やぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42281-42287">れ、</seg><ruby type="f